{"ID":"20240206113502-ik8pdlj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113502-ik8pdlj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113502-ik8pdlj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113511-icfo6e2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113507-fwy8i57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113511-icfo6e2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:192,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:192\u0026#125;","title":"大血藤（红藤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830164057"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113511-icfo6e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113511-icfo6e2","updated":"20240206113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖北、四川、江西、河南等地。\n【性状】\t干燥茎呈圆柱形，略弯曲，通常截成长约30cm的段状，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm。外表棕色或灰棕色，粗糙，具有浅的纵槽纹及明显的横裂纹，有时可见膨大的节部及略凹陷的枝痕或叶柄痕，栓皮常呈鳞片状开裂，脱落处露出淡红棕色的内皮部。质坚韧，有弹性，折断面裂片状；平整的横切面，本质部黄白色，导管呈细孔状，髓射线棕红色，放射状排列。气异香，味淡微涩。\n【性味】\t苦、平。\n【功效】\t败毒消痈，活血通络，祛风杀虫的作用。治急、慢性阑尾炎，风湿痹痛，赤痢，血淋，月经不调，疳积，虫痛，跌扑损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113507-fwy8i57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113507-fwy8i57","updated":"20240206113507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113507-tk7tph0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722170418-9axq6za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722170418-9axq6za","updated":"20240722170418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红藤"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红藤-20240205155613-g4eqi3r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711154812-nk6hsak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711154812-nk6hsak","updated":"20240711154812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大血藤 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大血藤 12-20240711154811-gaps782.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 280px;","style":"width: 270px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240711153236-wdyzl93.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 270px;\" parent-style=\"width: 280px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240830163924-8brfktn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163924-8brfktn","updated":"20240830163947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大血藤 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大血藤 14-20240711163217-i7k82t0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties